WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.643
- I need to let other people know

00:00:01.643 --> 00:00:03.904
there's a reason why I'm alone, you know,

00:00:03.904 --> 00:00:06.707
it's not cuz I'm alone.

00:00:06.707 --> 00:00:09.329
(jazzy music)

00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:10.899
My name's Eli and I'm single.

00:00:10.899 --> 00:00:13.001
I'm like super single,
I'm like drinking merlot,

00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:14.759
watching Parks and Rec on
a Saturday night single,

00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:16.410
that's like how single I am.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.894
I don't really go out alone by myself.

00:00:17.894 --> 00:00:19.873
I mean, I think it's just really awkward.

00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:21.241
I'm hoping throughout this week

00:00:21.241 --> 00:00:23.571
I just learn to be more
comfortable with myself

00:00:23.571 --> 00:00:26.245
and to be more comfortable being alone.

00:00:26.245 --> 00:00:28.898
So we're gonna have to
do a dinner by ourselves,

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:30.656
go to the movies,

00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:32.056
and $50 to do a date activity.

00:00:32.056 --> 00:00:33.236
This is the only time I'm unhappy

00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:35.014
that I'm having this
much money for dinner.

00:00:35.014 --> 00:00:36.140
(instrumental music)

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.720
I've only went out to eat by myself once.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.628
I went to a restaurant.

00:00:39.628 --> 00:00:42.031
I lasted all of like 10 minutes.

00:00:42.031 --> 00:00:43.848
I got the menu, I felt like
everyone was staring at me,

00:00:43.848 --> 00:00:45.855
I had all this anxiety, and I
just got the hell out of there

00:00:45.855 --> 00:00:48.550
so I'm hoping I can beat
that anxiety this week.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:52.515
Well it is the date portion
where I eat dinner by myself.

00:00:52.515 --> 00:00:54.705
I love Benihana so I wanted to go there.

00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:56.068
Currently alone,

00:00:56.068 --> 00:00:59.094
sitting by myself,
doing blogs as an excuse

00:00:59.094 --> 00:01:01.626
to not look like a creepy idiot.

00:01:01.626 --> 00:01:03.487
The wait staff's reactions
were similar to me

00:01:03.487 --> 00:01:05.608
like buying condoms at a store, it's like,

00:01:05.608 --> 00:01:07.182
oh, oh yeah, yeah, no whatever, whatever,

00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:08.401
just hide it, we'll just, here you go.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.219
There was a family there,

00:01:10.219 --> 00:01:12.072
you know, naturally we started talking

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.313
and got to know them.

00:01:14.313 --> 00:01:15.146
(laughing)

00:01:15.146 --> 00:01:16.094
(people groaning)

00:01:16.094 --> 00:01:17.314
- [Man] No head butts.

00:01:17.314 --> 00:01:19.662
- You know it really
forces you to socialize,

00:01:19.662 --> 00:01:23.411
kinda face those insecurities
head on, which is kinda cool.

00:01:23.411 --> 00:01:26.571
(people cheering)

00:01:26.571 --> 00:01:28.278
I'm late to the movie.

00:01:28.278 --> 00:01:29.131
I'm late to the movie.

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.469
I was like a half hour late to the movie

00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:33.035
so I pretty much bailed on myself.

00:01:33.035 --> 00:01:34.614
This is why I'm single.

00:01:34.614 --> 00:01:37.404
So now I am having a drink

00:01:37.404 --> 00:01:38.971
until the next showing.

00:01:38.971 --> 00:01:41.359
Needing one seat, I could
pretty much sit wherever I want.

00:01:41.359 --> 00:01:42.696
While they're ringing me up,

00:01:42.696 --> 00:01:44.445
I had all these couples in the other lines

00:01:44.445 --> 00:01:46.400
like struggling to find like good seats

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:47.652
at the same movie.

00:01:47.652 --> 00:01:49.462
I lasted half hour by myself.

00:01:49.462 --> 00:01:50.731
I think I'm doing pretty good.

00:01:50.731 --> 00:01:51.825
- [Man] Hello hello hello,

00:01:51.825 --> 00:01:54.054
how's everybody doing today?

00:01:54.054 --> 00:01:54.887
- Woo.

00:01:54.887 --> 00:01:55.720
(female laughing)

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:56.970
I ended up going into the movie theater

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.650
and my seat was seat 20

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:01.813
and there was a girl sitting at 21,

00:02:01.813 --> 00:02:03.605
and I assumed someone was gonna meet her,

00:02:03.605 --> 00:02:05.609
probably get popcorn for her or something.

00:02:05.609 --> 00:02:08.162
The movie starts and she's by herself

00:02:08.162 --> 00:02:10.169
and I was, I have to talk
to this girl afterwards.

00:02:10.169 --> 00:02:12.185
So I didn't sit next to
you because I assumed

00:02:12.185 --> 00:02:14.352
someone was coming to sit next to you.

00:02:14.352 --> 00:02:15.185
- No one was coming.

00:02:15.185 --> 00:02:17.023
I think it's important
to take time for yourself

00:02:17.023 --> 00:02:21.115
and be with your own self and be confident

00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:22.512
in going out by yourself.

00:02:22.512 --> 00:02:24.100
- True, I need that cuz I feel like

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:27.381
insecure or I feel like there's

00:02:27.381 --> 00:02:30.259
yeah, the world, the world sets it up,

00:02:30.259 --> 00:02:32.734
so if you're alone, you
look sad or something.

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.844
- Yeah, I find that stupid.

00:02:34.844 --> 00:02:35.722
- This is really strange,

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:37.243
I thought you were, you may like,

00:02:37.243 --> 00:02:39.260
hit me with your purse or run away

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.324
by me asking.

00:02:40.324 --> 00:02:42.747
- No, people are afraid
of like actual interaction

00:02:42.747 --> 00:02:43.732
with other people.

00:02:43.732 --> 00:02:45.009
- Changing the world.

00:02:45.009 --> 00:02:45.942
Don't use your cell phones.

00:02:45.942 --> 00:02:47.885
I think the fact that
I went on a date alone

00:02:47.885 --> 00:02:50.286
and then I met someone
is a success in itself.

00:02:50.286 --> 00:02:52.563
I'm noticing being alone,
I'm not worried about

00:02:52.563 --> 00:02:55.061
having to cater to somebody else.

00:02:55.061 --> 00:02:57.188
Like I can just kinda let my guard down

00:02:57.188 --> 00:02:59.073
and kinda like almost recharge in a way

00:02:59.073 --> 00:03:03.610
and I don't have to constantly
worry about the other person.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.719
So it's date number three

00:03:05.719 --> 00:03:08.383
and I've had a hard time
trying to figure out

00:03:08.383 --> 00:03:10.661
what I like to do for a date

00:03:10.661 --> 00:03:13.238
so I think I'm gonna do
something a little more chill.

00:03:13.238 --> 00:03:15.844
I decided to do a picnic in my backyard

00:03:15.844 --> 00:03:17.001
with just me.

00:03:17.001 --> 00:03:19.793
So I bought some wine
and I got chicken wings,

00:03:19.793 --> 00:03:21.715
mac and cheese, balled out.

00:03:21.715 --> 00:03:24.673
Yes, yes, this is a beautiful thing.

00:03:24.673 --> 00:03:26.628
I'm a simple guy, all I
want is mac and cheese.

00:03:26.628 --> 00:03:27.748
And I didn't have a blanket,

00:03:27.748 --> 00:03:28.893
so I had an inflatable mattress

00:03:28.893 --> 00:03:30.536
and I just threw it in
my backyard (laughing).

00:03:30.536 --> 00:03:31.369
As far as the third date goes,

00:03:31.369 --> 00:03:33.514
I don't think I've ever
done anything like that

00:03:33.514 --> 00:03:34.347
with myself.

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.261
Might be the wine
talking, but I don't know,

00:03:36.261 --> 00:03:37.461
I really needed this.

00:03:37.461 --> 00:03:39.542
It's really therapeutic, it's almost like

00:03:39.542 --> 00:03:40.782
kinda like meditation.

00:03:40.782 --> 00:03:41.645
Out of all the dates,

00:03:41.645 --> 00:03:43.894
I think that was probably the best one.

00:03:43.894 --> 00:03:46.122
A, because I love chicken wings

00:03:46.122 --> 00:03:48.162
and two, I was kinda really able

00:03:48.162 --> 00:03:50.136
just to be in my own head.

00:03:50.136 --> 00:03:52.139
(instrumental music)

00:03:52.139 --> 00:03:53.199
My week was great.

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.236
I feel like when I go to these things,

00:03:55.236 --> 00:03:56.323
when you're with someone,

00:03:56.323 --> 00:03:57.854
you're just kinda catering to that person

00:03:57.854 --> 00:03:59.141
and giving your energy to them.

00:03:59.141 --> 00:04:00.341
It was almost like a meditation

00:04:00.341 --> 00:04:01.850
just to kinda cater to me.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.784
When you're alone, you're
willing to give your energy

00:04:03.784 --> 00:04:06.134
within yourself and kinda be
open to the world around you.

00:04:06.134 --> 00:04:07.608
This gave me confidence to be by myself.

00:04:07.608 --> 00:04:10.032
If you resent the idea of going out alone,

00:04:10.032 --> 00:04:12.286
hey, I get it, but all you really need

00:04:12.286 --> 00:04:14.167
is like a glass of wine and a nice book

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:16.058
and you only look smart

00:04:16.058 --> 00:04:18.829
and you only look that much sexier.

00:04:18.829 --> 00:04:21.912
(instrumental music)

